 "news": {
  "date": "2026-09-21",
  "asof": "2026-09-22 14:21 UTC",
  "headline": "Two sigma on the Nasdaq and the S&P \u2014 and crude broke below $100 as Washington opened a door to Tehran",
  "standfirst": "The first clean session after a week of central-bank decisions produced the biggest move in weeks: the Nasdaq rose 2.26% and the S&P 1.49%, both above two sigma. Meta\u2019s Muse agent revived the CPU-demand trade \u2014 Intel +12.17%, AMD +9.95% and past $1 trillion, Meta itself +11.34% \u2014 one week after an essay asked AI companies to slow down. WTI broke below $100 to $97.79 after Trump said he would probably meet Iran\u2019s president at the UN and satellite data showed Saudi flows through Hormuz up fourfold on August, and the ten-year fell back to 4.951%. Every position in the book rose; GOOG crossed +1R for the first time and OKTA gained 4.91% into Wednesday\u2019s investor summit. Heat 3.05R against 3.0R.",
  "themes": [
   {
    "kicker": "What's next",
