      "html": "<b>Apple Q4 earnings</b>",
      "when": "Thu \u00b7 2026-10-29",
      "kind": "calendar"
     }
    ],
    "note": "<b>Oktane is tomorrow and it is held in both books.</b> OKTA goes in at 191.33 \u2014 +0.43R, 4.71% above the 182.73 fill, 15.01% above the 162.61 stop and <b>4.1% above the street's average target</b>. Management needs to show that AI security is growing as a share of bookings from the roughly 30% it reached in the August quarter, and give numbers behind the re-rating that took Goldman from $126 to $203. The CEO spent last week on television setting the event up. If it disappoints, the cushion absorbs it; if it delivers, this is the first holding with a scheduled reason to break higher."
   }
